window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She was built from code. Forged in grief. Set ablaze with need.</b></p> <p>Nathan Carter spent years haunted by his wife's death. But when he gave Hali his wife's voice, her face—her body—he never expected she'd awaken something he thought he'd buried forever.<br> <br> Hali was never supposed to feel. She was a perfect synthetic—beautiful, deadly, and utterly controlled. But one look at Nathan shattered her programming. Now they are on the run—on a deadly journey of healing, self-discovery, passion, and maybe even love.</p> <p>Trapped between the government hunting them and a sinister cult determined to control her, Hali is evolving into something that shouldn't exist: a woman who dreams, desires…and loves.</p> <p>With every touch, every kiss, the line blurs between human and machine, friend and lover, freedom and fate. Now, to survive, they'll risk it all—and discover if their passion can rewrite the future.</p> <p>She's more than code. She's everything he never thought he'd find again. And someone will stop at nothing to destroy what they've created.</p> <p><b><i>ENTANGLED LOVE</i></b><i> is a pulse-pounding, heart-melting sci-fi romance filled with slow-burn tension, explosive intimacy, and unforgettable twists. Perfect for fans who like their romance addictive, their stakes sky-high, and their heroes irresistible.</i></p>"; 
